Subject: [PATCH] Add neofetch-style GitHub profile README

Replace the narrative profile README with a terminal/neofetch card
matching the Andrew Grant layout: ASCII portrait, system info panel,
and a compact projects table below.

Includes a generator script, live stats JSON, and a daily GitHub Action
to refresh follower/repo/commit counts.
